Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div style="font-weight:600;font-size:12px;">Washer method — revolve R about y = c</div>

<label>f(x) =
  <input id="fx" type="text" value="x^2" />
</label>

<label>axis of revolution &nbsp;y =
  <input id="axisC" type="text" value="-1" />
</label>

<label>x (washer position): <span id="xOut">1.00</span>
  <input id="xPos" type="range" min="0" max="2" step="0.01" value="1" />
</label>

<div style="margin-top:2px;font-weight:600;">View</div>
